{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00056","headline":"望送魏徵葬 · 太宗皇帝","name":"望送魏徵葬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阊阖总金鞍，上林移玉辇。\n野郊怆新别，河桥非旧饯。\n惨日映峰沈，愁云随盖转。\n哀笳时断续，悲旌乍舒卷。\n望望情何极，浪浪泪空泫。\n无复昔时人，芳春共谁遣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}